<title>USA: Mine Safety to buy back up to 500,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Mine Safety to buy back up to 500,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mine Safety Appliance Co said its board authorized the company to buy back as many as 500,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The company will buy back the shares from time to time, depending on market conditions, in both private transcations and on the open market.</p>
<p>The company has 5,211,125 common shares outstanding, it said.</p>
<p>During 1996, it bought back 592,698 shares under previous authorizations by its board, it added.</p>
</text>
